and financial solutions. Commonwealth Bank of Australia was founded in 1911 and is based in Sydney, Australia.","fullTimeEmployees":48927,"city":"Sydney","country":"Australia","website":"https://www.commbank.com.au","industry":"Banks - Diversified","sector":"Financial Services"},"news":[],"info_date":"2026-10-24"}